findings.comment:
7.50.800e - The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled:
A) flat grill - general surfaces on underside (grease);
B) fryers - inside lower compartments, general surfaces on undersides, & wheels (grease/food debris);
C) grill line cooler - bottom inside (food crumbs);  and
D) Monster cooler - bottom inside and outer ledge (food splash).

Clean non-food contact surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris.

750.800e - The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled:
A) fryers - 1. underneath surfaces and 2. bottom around/behind mechanicals (grease/dust/food debris);
B) flat grill - side by fryers (grease);  
C) bottom inside upright freezers (crumbs);   and
D) metal cart in back prep area (general buildup/splash).

Clean non-food contact surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris.

750.800b - The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled:
A) shelf and foam mesh lining the shelf above the steam wells (crumbs/debris);
B) fryers - sides, legs, underneath surfaces, and inside lower panel behind mechanicals (grease/food debris);   
C) flat grill - sides, legs, underneath surfaces (grease);   and
D) behind flat grill (grease/food debris).

Clean non-food contact surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris.

750.800e - The following areas were observed to be soiled:
A) shelf and foam mesh lining shelf above steam wells (crumbs/debris);
B) under microwave (food debris);
C) under steam wells (food debris); 
D) behind flat grill (grease/food debris);   and
E) bottom inside grill cooler (food debris).

Clean non-food contact surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris.
